/*
 * Dispatches control-flow expressions to the appropriate semantic-validation
 * module.
 *
 * Control expressions(`ControlExpr`) represent all high-level control-flow
 * constructs in the Ymir language:
 *
 *   - atomic blocks,
 *   - await expressions,
 *   - conditional expressions(`if`, `if let`),
 *   - loops(`for`, `while`, `while let`),
 *   - lazy expressions,
 *   - match expressions,
 *   - spawn expressions,
 *   - unsafe blocks.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::control
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/control.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
